Please note that this code assumes the MAX9814 amplifier output is connected to the MCP3008 ADC's channel 0. You may need to adjust the ADC channel number based on your hardware setup. Also, the conversion from raw ADC value to voltage is not implemented, as it depends on the specific ADC's characteristics.

