This code sets up a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ to interface with a VL53L1X Time-of-Flight sensor via I2C, polls the sensor every 100ms, logs the distance measurements to a CSV file, and provides parking guidance based on the sensor readings. It also handles signal interrupts for graceful shutdown and error checking for all system calls and library functions.

