Please note that you need to have pigpio installed and properly configured on your Raspberry Pi for this code to work. Also, ensure that the VL53L1X sensor is correctly connected to the I2C bus (bus 1 in this case) and that the correct I2C address (0x2A) is used.

To compile this code, use a C compiler like gcc:

```bash
gcc -o vl53l1x_reader vl53l1x_reader.c -lpigpio -lrt
```

This command assumes that the pigpio library is installed and accessible in your system's library path. If not, you may need to provide the full path to the library during compilation.

