This code initializes the pigpio library, configures the GPIO pins, sets up an interrupt handler for the echo pin, and measures distances using the HC-SR04 sensor. It activates a buzzer when the distance is below 20 cm. The main loop runs every second, printing the distance to stdout. The SIGINT handler cleans up and exits cleanly.

