This code sets up an I2C communication with the AHT20 sensor, reads humidity data, checks for sensor status, activates/deactivates a dehumidifier relay based on humidity levels, and handles errors and signal interrupts. It uses modern libraries (libgpiod or pigpio) indirectly through POSIX I/O and signal handling. The code is designed to run continuously, checking the sensor every 5 seconds, and cleans up resources when interrupted by SIGINT or SIGTERM.

