This code initializes pigpio for GPIO control and I2C communication, sets up a falling-edge interrupt on GPIO27 for toggling data logging, reads calibration data from the BMP180 sensor, computes pressure using Bosch compensation formulas, and logs the pressure and timestamp to a file every 2 seconds. It also handles I2C communication errors and driver initialization failures, and cleans up resources on exit. The program gracefully terminates on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

