This code initializes the GPIO pins as outputs, simulates soil moisture readings, and controls the relays based on the moisture level. It logs the moisture readings and relay activations to `irrigation_log.txt` with ISO-8601 timestamps. The program handles signal handlers for SIGINT (Ctrl+C) and SIGTERM (kill command) to cleanly deactivate all relays, close the log file, and exit. It ensures each GPIO line is requested as an output only once.

