This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up signal handlers for SIGINT and SIGTERM, configures the GPIO pins as inputs with pull-up resistors, and runs a main loop reading the sensor states and sending an emergency stop message when all sensors detect an obstacle. It also handles errors and cleans up resources before exiting.
